  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> Maximum density of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> in gaseous phase will be at point 'A'<br />Now: <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>44</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>107</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0.107</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br />Or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>44</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>440</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> Density of liquid <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> at 60 atm (at point B)<br />At point B there will be only liquid <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> . So we can find out the density of density of liquid <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> only at point B.<br /><math> <mrow>  <mtext>d</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac>   <mtext>M</mtext>   <mtext>V</mtext>  </mfrac>  <mo>=</mo><mfrac>   <mrow>    <mn>44</mn></mrow>   <mrow>    <mn>0.044</mn></mrow>  </mfrac>  <mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>&#x00A0;gm/cc</mtext></mrow></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> at point C the volume will be <math> <mrow>  <mfrac>   <mrow>    <mn>0.44</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.044</mn></mrow>   <mn>2</mn>  </mfrac>  <mo>&#x2248;</mo><mn>0.22</mn><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>L</mtext></mrow></math><br />And pressure is same so obviously approx. half of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is liquified<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> Z can be greater than 1 at <math><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ο</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>. For example at point 'A' Z is 1.07, So wrong.",
